From: Lynder063 <lynderjekokot@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 13:50:23 +0000
Subject: tools inside openrac

Run the tools from inside OpenRAC.

The tree sits at games/rac1/pal inside OpenRAC. The tools find the editor (OpenRAC's editor/,
which took over tools/extract), the NTSC decomp (games/rac1/ntsc), the shared toolchains/
and baserom/, and name their commit scope rac1/pal. The Docker runner mounts all of OpenRAC.

Co-authored-by: Flavius <Flavius256@icloud.com>
